### ==============================================================================
### REST Client - Lab 03 REST API, Query Parameters, Validation & Debugging Tests
### Extension: REST Client (Huachao Mao)
### Student: S.S.M.Bharadwaj | 252U1R1231 | CSE-CORE-2E
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Root & Discovery Endpoints
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 API Directory & Student Metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Success Cases - Query Parameters on GET /books/
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 GET All Books (Default: limit=10, offset=0, order_by=id ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 GET Search by Title (search_q=JavaScript)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?search_q=JavaScript
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 GET Sorting by Price Descending (order_by=price&order=DESC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?order_by=price&order=DESC
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 GET Pagination (limit=3&offset=3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?limit=3&offset=3
Accept: application/json

### 2.5 GET Price Range Filter (min_price=400&max_price=800)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?min_price=400&max_price=800
Accept: application/json

### 2.6 GET Combined Query Filters (search_q, min/max price, sort, pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?search_q=the&min_price=200&max_price=900&order_by=price&order=DESC&limit=4&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### 2.7 GET Single Book by Valid ID (ID = 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1/
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. CRUD Mutations (POST, PUT, DELETE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 POST Create Book (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "System Design Interview",
  "author": "Alex Xu",
  "price": 850,
  "pages": 300
}

### 3.2 PUT Update Book (200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "The Pragmatic Programmer (20th Anniversary Edition)",
  "author": "David Thomas, Andrew Hunt",
  "price": 799,
  "pages": 360
}

### 3.3 DELETE Book (200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/15/
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Validation Failure Cases (400 Bad Request)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 POST Validation Error: Missing Title
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "author": "Alex Xu",
  "price": 850,
  "pages": 300
}

### 4.2 POST Validation Error: Missing Author
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "System Design Interview",
  "price": 850,
  "pages": 300
}

### 4.3 POST Validation Error: Non-numeric Price
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "System Design Interview",
  "author": "Alex Xu",
  "price": "eight-hundred-fifty",
  "pages": 300
}

### 4.4 POST Validation Error: Negative Price
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "System Design Interview",
  "author": "Alex Xu",
  "price": -100,
  "pages": 300
}

### 4.5 POST Validation Error: Non-positive Pages
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "System Design Interview",
  "author": "Alex Xu",
  "price": 500,
  "pages": -50
}

### 4.6 GET Validation Error: Invalid order_by column
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?order_by=invalid_column
Accept: application/json

### 4.7 GET Validation Error: Invalid order direction
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?order=DIAGONAL
Accept: application/json

### 4.8 GET Validation Error: Negative Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?limit=-5
Accept: application/json

### 4.9 GET Validation Error: Non-numeric ID in Path Parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/abc/
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Not Found Cases (404 Not Found)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 GET Book with Non-existent ID (ID = 999)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/999/
Accept: application/json

### 5.2 GET Unknown Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown-api-route/
Accept: application/json
